# Direct, hand-maintained dependencies for the NOKS backend.
#
# This file is the source of truth — `requirements.txt` is GENERATED from it
# and must never be hand-edited. To add or upgrade a dependency:
#
#   1. Edit this file.
#   2. From backend/, run: pip-compile --generate-hashes requirements.in
#   3. Commit both requirements.in and the regenerated requirements.txt.
#
# (One-off local setup: `pip install pip-tools` to get the pip-compile command.)

